@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Stored migration plan states
left to right direction
state "Preview not stored" as Preview
state "reviewable" as Reviewable
state "blocked" as Blocked
state "cancelled\n(no included writes)" as Cancelled
[*] --> Preview
Preview --> Reviewable : no blockers and included writes
Preview --> Cancelled : no blockers and no included writes
Preview --> Blocked : blockers found
Reviewable --> [*]
Blocked --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Reviewable --> Blocked : include a blocked operation
Blocked --> Reviewable : no blockers and included writes
Reviewable --> Cancelled : exclude all writes
Blocked --> Cancelled : no blockers or included writes
Cancelled --> Reviewable : include writes before first run
Cancelled --> Blocked : include a blocked operation
note bottom of Reviewable
Snapshots and decisions remain unchanged.
Inclusion changes update the approval digest
before the first run only.
Execution creates separate run records.
end note
@enduml
